    "document": "Legends: Orks",
    "section": "Legendary Proxies",
    "summary": "Use the Warbuggies profile for any of these four Ork vehicles: the Boomdakka Snazzwagon, the Kustom Boosta-blasta, the Megatrakk Scrapjet or the Shokkjump Dragsta. Field an Attack Fighta as a Dakkajet and Big Gunz as Mek Gunz. Use the Mega Armour Big Mek datasheet for a force-field Big Mek and keep the Kustom Force Field equipped. Count a Fighta-Bommer as a Biltza Bommer and a Kannonwagon as a Gunwagon. Use the Gorkanaut profile for a Mega Dread and the Morkanaut profile for a Meka Dread. Run Nobz on Warbikes as Warbikers and a Squiggoth as a Gargantuan Squiggoth. Field Ufthak Blackhawk as a Warboss and a Wurrboy as a Weirdboy.",
